              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The course ensured that participants acquire the skills and knowledge needed to perform this procedure effectively. Participants were actively engaged with realistic clinical scenarios and experienced hands-on practice with high-fidelity ultrasound simulators (Vimedix and SonoSim).",
